 for the first time on the Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studios, so you know we're really excited about this","leader":"Alexandr Wang","company":"Meta","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/apple-meta-partner-ai.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792083601.0},{"quote":"It has bugged me that what was my impact of not being there is a lead… helping her out when she was asking for help","leader":"Satya Nadella","company":"Microsoft","source":"Mint","url":"https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/satya-nadella-recalls-employee-he-failed-to-help-early-in-his-career-i-was-an-absent-leader-barking-orders-11792070800307.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792072960.0},{"quote":"From a data-scarce nation of less than 4 crore 4G customers to a data-abundant nation of 100 crore 4G and 5G customers happened over the last 10 years … Jio is the only player globally with proprietary end-to-end digital connectivity stack.","leader":"Uday Kotak","company":"Kotak Mahindra Bank","source":"Mint","url":"https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/uday-kotak-in-reliance-jio-ipo-press-conference-historic-issue-ril-to-become-largest-conglomerate-by-market-cap-11792060852077.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792060919.0},{"quote":"It (AI services) is growing at a fantastic pace. If you sort of extrapolate that by a few quarters, you already start to see that's 20-30 per cent of our work in a few quarters, and maybe in two or three years, almost half of our work","leader":"Salil Parekh","company":"Infosys","source":"Mint","url":"https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/infosys-says-80-000-employees-use-ai-coding-tools-why-is-it-still-hiring-20-000-graduates-11792030468356.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792034202.0},{"quote":"My own sense is it is good news for Infosys, and by sort of that same view, good news for the tech services in India","leader":"Salil Parekh","company":"Infosys","source":"Mint","url":"https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/infosys-says-80-000-employees-use-ai-coding-tools-why-is-it-still-hiring-20-000-graduates-11792030468356.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792034202.0},{"quote":"Many of the young companies are going through growing pains, and they’re growing incredibly fast. There’s an accountability, responsibility that goes along with building companies that they’re just growing into","leader":"Jensen Huang","company":"NVIDIA","source":"Mint","url":"https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/will-nvidia-supply-chips-to-develop-unsafe-ai-ceo-jensen-huang-plays-it-safe-it-s-hypothetical-but-11792033835837.html","date":"15 Oct","ts":1792034177.0},{"quote":"There have been different eras where we have different sets of, of leaders in place … I'm a constant, Sam [Altman] is a constant, and I think that we are stronger because of that resilience and diversity.","leader":"Greg Brockman","company":"OpenAI","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/14/openais-sachin-katti-to-leave-infrastructure-role-stay-on-as-advisor.html","date":"14 Oct","ts":1791998734.0}],"window_days":1,"leaders":[{"name":"Sam Altman","company":"OpenAI"},{"name":"Greg Brockman","company":"OpenAI"},{"name":"Dario Amodei","company":"Anthropic"},{"name":"Daniela Amodei","company":"Anthropic"},{"name":"Mike Krieger","company":"Anthropic"},{"name":"Sundar Pichai","company":"Google"},{"name":"Demis Hassabis","company":"Google DeepMind"},{"name":"Koray Kavukcuoglu","company":"Google"},{"name":"Jensen Huang","company":"NVIDIA"},{"name":"Lisa Su","company":"AMD"},{"name":"Satya Nadella","company":"Microsoft"},{"name":"Mustafa Suleyman","company":"Microsoft AI"},{"name":"Kevin Scott","company":"Microsoft"},{"name":"Mark Zuckerberg","company":"Meta"},{"name":"Alexandr Wang","company":"Meta"},{"name":"Liang Wenfeng","company":"DeepSeek"},{"name":"Yang Zhilin","company":"Moonshot AI (Kimi)"},{"name":"Arthur Mensch","company":"Mistral AI"},{"name":"Aravind Srinivas","company":"Perplexity"},{"name":"N Chandrasekaran","company":"Tata Sons"},{"name":"K Krithivasan","company":"TCS"},{"name":"Salil Pa